      <span class="eyebrow">The benefits</span>
      <h2>Why monitor plant?</h2>
      <p>By enabling a live feed of building plant operation, faults or inefficiencies can be identified easily when plant begins to operate outside of predetermined parameters – for example if a space or water temperature rises above an agreed level. Identifying issues immediately means they can be resolved quickly, leading to significant reductions in both energy consumption and costs.</p>
      <p>The technology can also improve the occupier experience by highlighting indoor environmental issues such as excessive temperature, humidity & CO₂ levels. GMA Air Conditioning can then advise and implement remedial actions – often at low cost – to improve the conditions.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Cloud portal</span>
      <h2>Live and historical data</h2>
      <p>Via 4D Monitoring's cloud-based portal, access asset performance data and occupier environment metrics in real time, or wind back the clock to see historical trends. The information is intuitive, easy to understand and accessible wherever you are.</p>
      <p>With live data to hand, site managers and service providers can ensure temperatures are kept to agreed levels and energy-consuming plant is operating to agreed timescales.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

